      "kind": "list",
      "text": "- **Friends:** keep it casual, link disclosure to shared activities or experiments (study method, puzzle night).\n- **Coworkers:** use as context for role fit or task allocation, but emphasize concrete contributions and avoid value-laden framing.\n- **Supervisors/HR:** present as part of a development plan or accommodation request with documentation and clear goals.\n- **Online communities:** avoid precise percentiles in volatile forums; use anonymized or aggregated language.\n- **Dating/close relationships:** be emotionally transparent; prioritize partnership over score.",
